cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HIV-DR-Watch in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SAWA (Sub-Saharan Africa Watch for Antiretroviral resistance): an open real-time antiretroviral-resistance surveillance platform"
abstract: >-
  SAWA is an open, reproducible pipeline for continuous
  antiretroviral-resistance surveillance from public sequence data
  (LANL, GenBank) with optional integration of partner clinical data.
  It produces subtype-stratified phylogenies, Stanford HIVdb resistance
  calls, and transmission-cluster estimates for sub-Saharan Africa,
  starting with HIV-1 in East Africa (Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania, Rwanda,
  Burundi, Ethiopia). The Python package is named `hivdrwatch`; the
  project's short public name is SAWA.
type: software
